# ── Generated product imagery ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are pipeline OUTPUT, not source: export_images.py renders them from the
# PNG masters in products/<slug>/01-angles/ and uploads them to the Supabase
# `product-images` bucket. The database stores absolute CDN URLs, so nothing
# reads this directory in production -- git does not need to carry it.
#
# Ignored per-directory rather than as a blanket `/public`, which also swallowed
# the fonts and category/campaign images the storefront genuinely serves from the
# bundle.
/public/images/products

# Local-only ChatGPT design reference renders (large binaries, never push)
sketches/design-renders/chatgpt-v2/

# Design reference screenshots (42 MB of PNGs, captured 2026-10-13)
# Visual targets only — not imported by any component. The README that indexes
# them stays tracked; the images themselves do not belong in git.
design-references/**/*.png
sketches/**/*.png
